#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:2
msgid "Scaling Morpheus Nodes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:4
msgid ""
"Morpheus App nodes can be scaled to accommodate additional load. "
"Appliance nodes can be scaled vertically in centralized architectures, "
"and both vertically and horizontally in distributed architectures."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:7
msgid "Vertical Scaling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:9
msgid ""
"In all Appliance Architectures, Application nodes can be vertically "
"scaled at any time, however a reconfigure must be performed for "
"additional resources to be utilized by |morpheus| on a node, which will "
"result in the ``morpheus-ui`` restarting on the reconfiguring node."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:11
msgid ""
"Morpheus configures memory/ram utilization for services during the "
"``reconfigure`` process. If additional memory/ram is added to a Host or "
"VM running the Morpheus App, the additional memory/ram will not be "
"utilized by the Morpheus Application until a ``morpheus-ctl reconfigure``"
" command is ran and the additional memory/ram is recognized."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:13
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:13
msgid ""
"When the ``morpheus-ctl reconfigure`` command detects changes on "
"available memory/ram, it will restart the ``morpheus-ui`` service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:15
msgid "The impact on Availability depends on the Morpheus Appliance Architecture."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:17
msgid "Centralized Appliances"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:18
msgid "Morpheus will be unavailable while the ``morpheus-ui`` restarts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:19
msgid "Distributed Appliances"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:20
msgid ""
"Zero-down time can be achieved by Reconfiguring one App Node at a time, "
"with proper Front-End Load Balancer configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:23
msgid "Horizontal Scaling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:25
msgid ""
"Additional Morpheus App Nodes can be added at any time to Fully "
"Distributed Architectures."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:27
msgid "Configure Shared Storage paths for the new App Node(s)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:28
msgid ""
"Install, but do not run the ``morpheus-ctl reconfigure`` command on the "
"new App Node(s), using the same Morpheus version as the existing "
"Appliance nodes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:29
msgid "Copy the ``morpheus.rb`` from an existing App Node to the new App Node(s)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:30
msgid ""
"Ensure permissions and network configuration for the new App Node(s) to "
"access all MySQL and Elasticsearch nodes, and the RabbitMQ VIP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:31
msgid ""
"Ensure permissions and network configuration for all required UI services"
" and Integrations, such as network access to ESXi hosts over 443 for "
"Hypervisor console and/or image transfers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:32
msgid "Add associated SSL files and configuration which is not on shared storage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:33
msgid "Reconfigure the new App Node(s) via ``morpheus-ctl reconfigure``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:34
msgid "Verify UI startup succeeded"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:35
msgid "Add New App Node(s) to Front End Morpheus UI Load Balancer pool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:37
msgid ""
"During ``morpheus-ctl reconfigure``, the new App Node(s) will validate "
"and be configured to use the existing tiers for the UI service. Upon "
"successful reconfigure, the Morpheus service will be available on the App"
" Node(s) with consistent data and capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:39
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/scaling.rst:39
msgid ""
"No services, including ``morpheus-ui``, are required to be shut down on "
"existing nodes when adding new App Nodes"
msgstr ""

